</style></head><body><div class="root"><div><div id="__next"><div data-reactroot=""><div class="detail__Div-s74hebt-0 ddUpuw"><div class="TopBanner__Div-kt5emi-0 eyqELv"><div class="banner"><img class="close" src="https://cdnjs.cailianpress.com/images/msite/banner_close.png"/><img class="logo" src="https://cdnjs.cailianpress.com/images/msite/top_banner_img.png"/><a href="http://a.app.qq.com/o/simple.jsp?pkgname=com.lanjinger.choiassociatedpress"><img class="download" src="https://cdnjs.cailianpress.com/images/msite/app_download.png"/></a></div></div><div class="border"><a href="/index"><img class="logo" src="https://cdnjs.cailianpress.com/images/msite/logo.png"/></a></div><div class="imgWrap"><img class="img" src="https://img.cls.cn/images/20240924/N6u81qE09X.png"/></div><div class="article"><div class="f-s-26 f-f-pm l-h-123077 title-box">收评：沪指涨4.15%创4年多来最大单日涨幅 两市成交额超9700亿</div><section class="f-s-15 l-h-146667 c-747474 abstract-box"></section><section class="l-h-1 c-b8b8b8 information-box"><div class="flex flex-between-center"><div class="flex flex-start-center flex-wrap"><div class="f-s-13 flex-shrink-0 time">2024-09-24 15:03 星期二</div><div class="f-s-13 author"></div></div></div></section><section class="content-box"><div class="content">【收评：沪指涨4.15%创4年多来最大单日涨幅 两市成交额超9700亿】财联社9月24日电，市场全天放量大涨，三大指数均涨超4%，沪指创2020年7月6日以来最大单日涨幅。沪深两市今日成交额9713亿，较上个交易日放量4203亿。盘面上，大金融股全线爆发，太平洋、首创证券、弘业期货、九鼎投资等10余股涨停，东方财富涨超10%。白酒股午后大涨，皇台酒业涨停，贵州茅台涨超8%。钢铁股震荡走强，中南股份、新钢股份、安阳钢铁、八一钢铁等近10股涨停。新能源赛道股展开反弹，德方纳米、龙蟠科技、弘元绿能、TCL中环等涨停。总体上个股涨多跌少，全市场超5100只个股上涨。板块方面，多元金融、钢铁、证券、白酒等板块涨幅居前，无下跌板块。截至收盘，沪指涨4.15%，深成指涨4.36%，创业板指涨5.54%。</div><div class="w-100p bottom-tips-box"><div class="f-s-13 l-h-157143 c-a5a2a2 bottom-tips">财联社声明：文章内容仅供参考，不构成投资建议。投资者据此操作，风险自担。</div></div></section></div><div class="comment">热门评论</div><div class="CommentItems__Div-s16xna7h-0 khOXkB"><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20230309/cailianpress0337098980.png" class="avatar"/><span class="name">cls-踢出一脚香蕉球<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·甘肃</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">0</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">祝福</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20230309/cailianpress0337098980.png" class="avatar"/><span class="name">cls-yuanwang1818<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·上海</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">0</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">拉3根大阳线</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20230309/cailianpress0337098980.png" class="avatar"/><span class="name">冲天炮2000<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">0</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">明天呢？</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20230309/cailianpress0337098980.png" class="avatar"/><span class="name">cls-1882002<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">0</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">小编太激动了，创业板涨字写成了张，哈哈。</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://img.cls.cn/images/20210621/KszIzAq24Y.png" class="avatar"/><span class="name">A* [爱心]别致的温柔10<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">0</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">一天指数收回2863，8月21日跌一个月，一天收回，股票却没回，有个屁用？指数跌的时候跌一个月你试试</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20230309/cailianpress0337098980.png" class="avatar"/><span class="name">越洣<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">0</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">昨天重仓满仓进的</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20230309/cailianpress0337098980.png" class="avatar"/><span class="name">越洣<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">1</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">今天感谢市场</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20230306/cailianpress022237785.png" class="avatar"/><span class="name">cls-xi4ht3<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">0</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">大涨一天，阴跌10天的行情有什么好说的</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20240320/cailianpress1044547743.jpg" class="avatar"/><span class="name">范德漪彪<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">1</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">唉 还在被涨跌牵动情绪吗 免不了七亏二平一赚</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20230309/cailianpress0337098980.png" class="avatar"/><span class="name">cls-vh3pz2<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">0</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">都是一片看跌的[阴险][阴险]</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20230309/cailianpress0337098980.png" class="avatar"/><span class="name">cls-1856811<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">3</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">我就想问问上市公司贷款回购股票以后，他也不可能注销。他唯一的方法就是拉高吃差价，然后还贷款，自己挣点小钱。最后还不是要拉高出货？关键这是不是就鼓励上市公司大股东贷款炒自己公司的股票呢。？哪位大神来给分析一下？</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20251211/02vdHdjEj7W7MZI_512x512.jpg" class="avatar"/><span class="name">观潮tide<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png" class="zan_avatar"/><span class="zan_num">0</span></span></div><div class="ex_content">你忍受不了50%的下跌就等不到5%的暴涨[发怒]</div></div></div><div class="CommentItem__Div-s1q2jj2d-0 ipbqDr"><div class="explain"><div class="top"><img src="https://image.cls.cn/cailianpress/avatar/20231213/cailianpress0218503507.jpg" class="avatar"/><span class="name">吉你罗友<span class="reply">回复</span></span><span class="cm_time">2年前<!-- -->·IP未知</span><span class="zan"><img src="/public/images/zan_normal.png"